---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const footerLinks = [
  { href: "/catering", label: "Catering", tone: "mint" },
  { href: "/om-oss", label: "Om", tone: "lilac" },
  { href: "/kontakt", label: "Kontakt", tone: "yellow" },
  {
    href: "/kontakt",
    label: "Boka",
    tone: "pink",
    booking: true,
  },
];
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-cell footer-cell--brand">
    <a
      class="footer-wordmark"
      href="/"
      aria-label="Pedalling Pizza Palace, hem"
    >
      Pedalling<br />Pizza<br />Palace
    </a>
    <p>
      En foodtruck med napolitansk vedugnspizza, redo att rulla in vart ni
      vill.
    </p>
    <p class="footer-slogan">Vår deg mot er deg.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-cell footer-cell--booking">
    <span class="glyph-mark footer-booking-mark footer-booking-mark--pedals" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="glyph-mark footer-booking-mark footer-booking-mark--pizza" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="glyph-mark footer-booking-mark footer-booking-mark--castle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-cell footer-cell--details">
    <p>Stockholm, Uppsala, Göteborg och vägarna däremellan.</p>
  </div>

  <nav class="footer-cell footer-cell--nav" aria-label="Footer navigation">
    {
      footerLinks.map((link) =>
        link.booking ? (
          <button class="footer-link" type="button" data-tone={link.tone} data-booking-trigger>
            {link.label}
          </button>
        ) : (
          <a class="footer-link" href={link.href} data-tone={link.tone}>
            {link.label}
          </a>
        ),
      )
    }
  </nav>

  <div class="footer-cell footer-cell--legal">
    <p class="footer-privacy">
      Vi sparar bara det ni skickar i formuläret för att svara med en offert,
      och delar det aldrig vidare. Vill ni att vi raderar era uppgifter, mejla{" "}
      <a href="mailto:pedallingpizzapalace@gmail.com">pedallingpizzapalace@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
    <span>&copy; {year}</span>
  </div>
</footer>
